							<h1 id="page-title">District Maps</h1>
						<div class="content-body">
	<h2>Monroe County Downloadable&nbsp;<u>GIS files</u></h2>

<ul>
	<li><a data-link-ext="xlsx" href="/files/boe/Maps/Shapefiles/LTED%20Matrix%202025.xlsx">LT/ED Matrix (.xlsx Download)</a></li>
	<li><a data-link-ext="pdf" href="/files/boe/Maps/Shapefiles/CODES%20FOR%20LT-TOWN%202024.pdf">Codes for Matrix</a></li>
	<li><a href="/files/boe/Maps/Shapefiles/Monroe_ED-Fixed_01-31-2024.zip">LT/ED Boundaries&nbsp;Shapefile (.zip Download)</a></li>
	<li><a href="/files/boe/Maps/Shapefiles/Senate_Dist_2023.zip">State Senate Boundaries&nbsp;Shapefile (.zip Download)</a></li>
	<li><a href="/files/boe/Maps/Shapefiles/Assembly_Dist_2024.zip">State Assembly Boundaries Shapefile (.zip Download)</a></li>
	<li><a href="/files/boe/Maps/Shapefiles/Legislative_Dist_2023.zip">County Legislature Boundaries Shapefile (.zip Download)</a></li>
	<li><a href="/files/boe/Maps/Shapefiles/City_Council_Dist_2023.zip">Rochester City Council Boundaries Shapefile (.zip Download)</a></li>
	<li><a href="/files/boe/Maps/Shapefiles/Greece_Ward_Dist_2023.zip">Greece Ward Boundaries Shapefile (.zip Download)</a></li>
	<li><a href="/files/boe/Maps/Shapefiles/Village_Boundaries_2023.zip">Village Boundaries Shapefile (.zip Download)</a></li>
</ul>

<hr />
<div class="rcols rcols2">
<div class="rcol rcol1">
<h3><a id="maps" name="maps"></a>Monroe County Voting District Maps&nbsp;</h3>

<p>The Board of Elections is able to provide voters and the community with high-quality, full-color maps.&nbsp; All district maps are available for purchase at the Board of Elections office: 435 Smith Street, Rochester, NY 14608.</p>

<p>Maps are also available online (see below) to view, download, or print yourself.</p>

<p><a data-link="out" href="http://www.elections.ny.gov/" target="_blank"><span class="txt-bg-green">*Visit the New York State Board of Elections for maps encompassing state and/or federal jurisdictions.*</span></a></p>

<ul>
</ul>
</div>

<div class="rcol rcol2">
<p style="text-align:center"><a data-link-ext="pdf" href="/files/boe/Maps/2024%20Maps/LD%20Countywide%2C%20LD%20Labeled%2C%20Towns%20Shaded.pdf"><img alt="Countywide Map" height="394" src="/files/boe/Pictures/LD%20Countywide%2C%20LD%20Labeled%2C%20Towns%20Shaded%20(3)/LD%20Countywide%2C%20LD%20Labeled%2C%20Towns%20Shaded-500.jpg" style="float:left" width="500" /></a><a data-link-ext="pdf" href="/files/boe/Maps/2024%20Maps/LD%20Countywide%2C%20LD%20Labeled%2C%20Towns%20Shaded.pdf">County Wide (Towns Shaded, LDs Labeled w/o EDs)</a></p>
</div>
</div>

<hr />
